{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00605","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 大成舞 · 魏徵、褚亮","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 大成舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"周称王季，晋美帝文。\n明明盛德，穆穆齐芬。\n藏用四履，屈道三分。\n铿锵锺石，载纪鸿勳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏徵、褚亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00605.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00605","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}